- **bac**: One swap (between 'b' and 'a') to get "abc", so output "YES".
- **bca**: Two swaps needed, so output "NO".
- **cab**: Two swaps needed, so output "NO".
- **cba**: One swap (between 'c' and 'b') to get "abc", so output "YES".

This solution efficiently checks the condition and outputs the result for each test case.
