response:
Certainly! The breakdown you're seeing on your invoice is likely due to different types of taxes applied at different stages of your journey. In Canada, taxes like GST (Goods and Services Tax) and HST (Harmonized Sales Tax) can vary by province and can be applied at different rates depending on the service.

