        // Handle the inference results
    }
}

// Usage
new InferTask().execute();
```

### Conclusion
By following these steps and strategies, you can increase the CPU utilization in your ONNX runtime Android application. Ensure that you profile your application to understand where the bottlenecks are and continuously optimize your model and code.
