\ket{\psi} = \frac{\ket{00} + \ket{01} + \ket{10}}{\sqrt{3}}
\]

The density matrix \(\rho\) corresponding to the state \(\ket{\psi}\) is given by:

\[
\rho = \ket{\psi}\bra{\psi}
\]

