</body>
</html>
```

### Step 2: CSS Styling

Add the following CSS to style the elements:

```css
/* styles.css */
body {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    height: 100vh;
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    margin: 0;
}

.slider-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #fff;
}

#circle {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 5px solid #000;
}

#concentric-circles {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
