### Conclusion
This guide provides a basic implementation of a chat app using `transformers.js` and `facebook/blenderbot-400m-distill`. You can further enhance the app by adding more features like handling multiple users, improving the UI, and refining the conversation flow.<|The End of Assistant B's Answer|>

